rs will ___ into the missing funds.","answer":"look","alt":[],"en":"look into","fa":"رسیدگی کردن","note":"look into a matter","traps":[],"distractors":["search","see"]},{"id":"phr065","unit":"phrasal","skill":"vocabulary","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"He ___ out two flaws in the design.","answer":"pointed","alt":[],"en":"point out","fa":"اشاره کردن، گوشزد کردن","note":"point out a problem","traps":[],"distractors":["showed up","said"]},{"id":"phr066","unit":"phrasal","skill":"vocabulary","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"The new policy ___ about real change.","answer":"brought","alt":[],"en":"bring about","fa":"به وجود آوردن","note":"bring about a change","traps":[],"distractors":["carried","came"]},{"id":"phr067","unit":"phrasal","skill":"vocabulary","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"Don't ___ up; the syntax is almost right.","answer":"give","alt":[],"en":"give up","fa":"تسلیم شدن","note":"give up doing something","traps":[],"distractors":["leave","put"]},{"id":"phr068","unit":"phrasal","skill":"vocabulary","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"I can't ___ out why the test fails.","answer":"figure","alt":[],"en":"figure out","fa":"سر در آوردن","note":"figure out a puzzle/why","traps":[],"distractors":["work on","solve out"]},{"id":"phr069","unit":"phrasal","skill":"vocabulary","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"I ___ into an old classmate at the bazaar.","answer":"ran","alt":[],"en":"run into","fa":"به‌طور تصادفی دیدن","note":"run into someone","traps":[],"distractors":["bumped on","met with"]},{"id":"phr070","unit":"phrasal","skill":"vocabulary","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"It is hard to ___ up with the news cycle.","answer":"keep","alt":[],"en":"keep up with","fa":"هم‌قدم ماندن با","note":"keep up with something","traps":[],"distractors":["catch on","follow up"]},{"id":"phr071","unit":"phrasal","skill":"vocabulary","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"Try to ___ down on sugar this month.","answer":"cut","alt":[],"en":"cut down on","fa":"کاهش دادن","note":"cut down on something","traps":[],"distractors":["lower","drop off"]},{"id":"phr072","unit":"phrasal","skill":"vocabulary","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"I ___ across an old letter in the drawer.","answer":"came","alt":[],"en":"come across","fa":"به‌طور تصادفی پیدا کردن","note":"come across something","traps":[],"distractors":["found over","met"]},{"id":"phr073","unit":"phrasal","skill":"vocabulary","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"Who will ___ with angry customers?","answer":"deal","alt":[],"en":"deal with","fa":"رسیدگی کردن به","note":"deal with a problem/person","traps":[],"distractors":["do up","treat with"]},{"id":"phr074","unit":"phrasal","skill":"vocabulary","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"He ___ up teaching and went into finance.","answer":"gave","alt":[],"en":"give up","fa":"رها کردن","note":"give up a career","traps":[],"distractors":["left from","dropped off"]},{"id":"phr075","unit":"phrasal","skill":"vocabulary","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"We ___ up paying more than we planned.","answer":"ended","alt":[],"en":"end up","fa":"در نهایت به جایی رسیدن","note":"end up doing something","traps":[],"distractors":["finished to","closed"]},{"id":"phr076","unit":"phrasal","skill":"vocabulary","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"The deal ___ through at the last minute.","answer":"fell","alt":[],"en":"fall through","fa":"خوانده نشدن، شکست خوردن","note":"fall through = fail","traps":[],"distractors":["dropped","broke"]},{"id":"phr077","unit":"phrasal","skill":"vocabulary","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"Do you ___ along with your coworkers?","answer":"get","alt":[],"en":"get along with","fa":"کنار آمدن با","note":"get along/on with someone","traps":[],"distractors":["go along to","walk"]},{"id":"phr078","unit":"phrasal_c1","skill":"vocabulary","level":"C1","kind":"cloze","prompt":"Please ___ in your assignment by Thursday.","answer":"hand","alt":[],"en":"hand in","fa":"تحویل دادن","note":"hand in work","traps":[],"distractors":["give in to","deliver"]},{"id":"phr079","unit":"phrasal_c1","skill":"vocabulary","level":"C1","kind":"cloze","prompt":"___ on a moment, I am almost done.","answer":"Hold","alt":[],"en":"hold on","fa":"صبر کردن","note":"hold on = wait","traps":[],"distractors":["Stay","Keep"]},{"id":"phr080","unit":"phrasal_c1","skill":"vocabulary","level":"C1","kind":"cloze","prompt":"I ___ forward to seeing the final cut.","answer":"look","alt":[],"en":"look forward to","fa":"بی‌صبرانه منتظر بودن","note":"look forward to + ing","traps":[],"distractors":["wait forward","hope"]},{"id":"phr081","unit":"phrasal_c1","skill":"vocabulary","level":"C1","kind":"cloze","prompt":"The kids ___ up an excuse about traffic.","answer":"made","alt":[],"en":"make up","fa":"داستان‌سرایی کردن، جعل کردن","note":"make up an excuse/story","traps":[],"distractors":["invented out","built"]},{"id":"phr082","unit":"phrasal_c1","skill":"vocabulary","level":"C1","kind":"cloze","prompt":"Do not ___ up such a rare offer.","answer":"pass","alt":[],"en":"pass up","fa":"از دست دادن یک فرصت","note":"pass up an opportunity","traps":[],"distractors":["throw","miss down"]},{"id":"phr083","unit":"phrasal_c1","skill":"vocabulary","level":"C1","kind":"cloze","prompt":"She ___ off the presentation despite nerves.","answer":"pulled","alt":[],"en":"pull off","fa":"با موفقیت انجام دادن کار سختی","note":"pull off something difficult","traps":[],"distractors":["carried off to","managed to"]},{"id":"phr084","unit":"phrasal_c1","skill":"vocabulary","level":"C1","kind":"cloze","prompt":"I will not ___ up with rude reviews.","answer":"put","alt":[],"en":"put up with","fa":"تحمل کردن","note":"put up with something","traps":[],"distractors":["tolerate up","stand with"]},{"id":"phr085","unit":"phrasal_c1","skill":"vocabulary","level":"C1","kind":"cloze","prompt":"The police ___ out sabotage early on.","answer":"ruled","alt":[],"en":"rule out","fa":"مسترد کردن، کنار گذاشتن","note":"rule out a possibility","traps":[],"d