,"unit":"phrasal_c1","skill":"vocabulary","level":"C1","kind":"cloze","prompt":"Cheap cables ___ out within months.","answer":"wear","alt":[],"en":"wear out","fa":"از پا افتادن، فرسوده شدن","note":"wear out","traps":[],"distractors":["tear off","use over"]},{"id":"phr094","unit":"phrasal_c1","skill":"vocabulary","level":"C1","kind":"cloze","prompt":"The numbers ___ out; we can ship Friday.","answer":"work","alt":[],"en":"work out","fa":"درست از آب درآمدن","note":"work out = resolve/succeed","traps":[],"distractors":["count up","come to"]},{"id":"phr095","unit":"phrasal_c1","skill":"vocabulary","level":"C1","kind":"cloze","prompt":"Always ___ up the database before updates.","answer":"back","alt":[],"en":"back up","fa":"نسخه پشتیبان گرفتن","note":"back up files","traps":[],"distractors":["support","copy under"]},{"id":"phr096","unit":"phrasal_c1","skill":"vocabulary","level":"C1","kind":"cloze","prompt":"I need to ___ up on my French before June.","answer":"brush","alt":[],"en":"brush up on","fa":"تمرین دوباره کردن","note":"brush up on a skill","traps":[],"distractors":["polish","refresh on"]},{"id":"phr097","unit":"phrasal_c1","skill":"vocabulary","level":"C1","kind":"cloze","prompt":"Stay late and ___ up with the backlog.","answer":"catch","alt":[],"en":"catch up with","fa":"عقب‌ماندگی را جبران کردن","note":"catch up with/on","traps":[],"distractors":["chase","reach"]},{"id":"awl098","unit":"awl","skill":"vocabulary","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"A close ___ of the data reveals a flaw.","answer":"analysis","alt":[],"en":"analysis","fa":"تحلیل","note":"analysis (n), analyse (v)","traps":[],"distractors":["analyze","analyses"]},{"id":"awl099","unit":"awl","skill":"vocabulary","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"Her ___ to the problem is refreshingly simple.","answer":"approach","alt":[],"en":"approach","fa":"رویکرد","note":"approach to something","traps":[],"distractors":["method to","way of treat"]},{"id":"awl100","unit":"awl","skill":"vocabulary","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"We must ___ the risks before launch.","answer":"assess","alt":[],"en":"assess","fa":"ارزیابی کردن","note":"assess a situation","traps":[],"distractors":["judge for","estimate"]},{"id":"awl101","unit":"awl","skill":"vocabulary","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"___ that the server is down, what then?","answer":"Assuming","alt":[],"en":"assume","fa":"فرض کردن","note":"assuming (that) = if we suppose","traps":[],"distractors":["Supposing in","Taking"]},{"id":"awl102","unit":"awl","skill":"vocabulary","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"Only the ___ can declare war here.","answer":"authority","alt":[],"en":"authority","fa":"مرجع قدرت","note":"the authorities","traps":[],"distractors":["government word: author","author"]},{"id":"awl103","unit":"awl","skill":"vocabulary","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"The archive is freely ___ to students.","answer":"available","alt":[],"en":"available","fa":"در دسترس","note":"available to someone","traps":[],"distractors":["accessible for","handy"]},{"id":"awl104","unit":"awl","skill":"vocabulary","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"Regular sleep has clear health ___ .","answer":"benefits","alt":[],"en":"benefit","fa":"منفعت","note":"benefit from something","traps":[],"distractors":["profits in","goods"]},{"id":"awl105","unit":"awl","skill":"vocabulary","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"The course builds on three core ___ .","answer":"concepts","alt":[],"en":"concept","fa":"مفهوم","note":"a concept of/behind","traps":[],"distractors":["concepts word: ideas only","conception"]},{"id":"awl106","unit":"awl","skill":"vocabulary","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"The committee ___ of nine members.","answer":"consists","alt":[],"en":"consist of","fa":"تشکیل شدن از","note":"consist of (no passive)","traps":[],"distractors":["composes of","contains of"]},{"id":"awl107","unit":"awl","skill":"vocabulary","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"Words change meaning depending on ___ .","answer":"context","alt":[],"en":"context","fa":"بافت و زمینه","note":"in the context of","traps":[],"distractors":["texture","contest"]},{"id":"awl108","unit":"awl","skill":"vocabulary","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"The trial will ___ over six months.","answer":"run","alt":[],"en":"run over a period","fa":"در طول بودن","note":"over a period of six months","traps":[],"distractors":["during","within of"]},{"id":"awl109","unit":"awl","skill":"vocabulary","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"The state will ___ the new rules next year.","answer":"implement","alt":[],"en":"implement","fa":"اجرا کردن","note":"implement a policy","traps":[],"distractors":["inplement","realize"]},{"id":"awl110","unit":"awl","skill":"vocabulary","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"Scientists ___ a link between sleep and memory.","answer":"identify","alt":[],"en":"identify","fa":"شناسایی کردن","note":"identify a link/cause","traps":[],"distractors":["prove up","detect on"]},{"id":"awl111","unit":"awl","skill":"vocabulary","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"The survey ___ widespread dissatisfaction.","answer":"indicates","alt":[],"en":"indicate","fa":"نشان دادن","note":"indicate that","traps":[],"distractors":["signals out","points"]},{"id":"awl112","unit":"awl","skill":"vocabulary","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"Two factors ___ in the price surge.","answer":"involved","alt":[],"en":"be involved in","fa":"درگیر بودن در","note":"be involved in something","traps":[],"distractors":["included to","concerned of"]},{"id":"awl113","unit":"awl","skill":"vocabulary","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"Access to clean water is a human ___ .","answer":"issue","alt":[],"en":"issue","fa":"مسئله مهم","note":"a key/pressing issue","traps":[],"distractors":["topic paper","output"]},{"id":"awl114","unit":"awl","skill":"vocabulary","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"The law requires ___ consent from parents.","answer":"explicit","alt":[],"en":"explicit","fa":"صریح","note":"explicit consent","traps":[],"distractors":["expressive","implicit"]},{"id":"awl115","unit":"awl","skill":"vocabulary","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"Cost is a major ___ in the decision.","answer":"factor","alt":[],"en":"factor","fa":"عامل","note":"a factor in something","traps":[],"distractors":["fact","agent"]},{"id":"awl116","unit":"awl","skill":"vocabulary","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"Their estimate ___ the real cost by half.","answer":"understates","alt":[],"en":"understate","fa":"کم‌نمایی کردن","note":"understate/overstate","traps":[],"distractors":["lowerstates","misstate"]},{"id":"awl117","unit":"awl","skill":"vocabulary","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"There is ___ evidence for the claim.","answer":"little","alt":[],"en":"little evidence","fa":"اندک شواهدی","note":"little + uncountable","traps":[],"distractors":["few","a few of"]},{"id":"awl118","unit":"awl_c1","skill":"vocabulary","level":"C1","kind":"cloze","prompt":"The word ___ two related meanings in law.","answer":"carries","alt":[],"en":"carry a meaning","fa":"معنایی را حمل کردن","note":"carry a meaning/connotation","traps":[],"distractors":["holds in","takes"]},{"id":"awl119","unit":"awl_c1","skill":"vocabulary","level":"C1","kind":"cloze","prompt":"The finding has been widely ___ in the field.","answer":"cited","alt":[],"en":"cite","fa":"استناد کردن","note":"cite a source","traps":[],"distractors":["sited","quoted in"]},{"id":"awl120","unit":"awl_c1","skill":"vocabulary","level":"C1","kind":"cloze","prompt":"The data ___ the earlier hypothesis.","answer":"contradicts","alt":[],"en":"contradict","fa":"نقض کردن","note":"contradict a claim","traps":[],"distractors":["contrast to","deny of"]},{"id":"awl121","unit":"awl_c1","skill":"vocabulary","level":"C1","kind":"cloze","prompt":"Oil revenues ___ the entire budget.","answer":"dominate","alt":[],"en":"dominate","fa":"چیره بودن بر","note":"dominate a market","traps":[],"distractors":["rule over to","master"]},{"id":"awl122","unit":"awl_c1","skill":"vocabulary","level":"C1","kind":"cloze","prompt":"The rule no longer ___ to freelancers.","answer":"applies","alt":[],"en":"apply to","fa":"شامل شدن، مصداق داشتن","note":"apply to someone","traps":[],"distractors":["fit to","belong"]},{"id":"awl123","unit":"awl_c1","skill":"vocabulary","level":"C1","kind":"cloze","prompt":"The two effects are hard to ___ .","answer":"isolate","alt":[],"en":"isolate","fa":"جدا کردن","note":"isolate a variable","traps":[],"distractors":["island","seclude"]},{"id":"awl124","unit":"awl_c1","skill":"vocabulary","level":"C1","kind":"cloze","prompt":"The theorem was later ___ by another team.","answer":"verified","alt":[],"en":"verify","fa":"راستی‌آزمایی کردن","note":"verify a result","traps":[],"distractors":["verity","confirmed in"]},{"id":"awl125","unit":"awl_c1","skill":"vocabulary","level":"C1","kind":"cloze","prompt":"A ___ of studies supports the method.","answer":"body","alt":[],"en":"a body of evidence","fa":"پیکره‌ای از شواهد","note":"a body of work/evidence","traps":[],"distractors":["bunch","collection of a"]},{"id":"awl126","unit":"awl_c1","skill":"vocabulary","level":"C1","kind":"cloze","prompt":"The sample was ___ small to be conclusive.","answer":"too","alt":[],"en":"too small to","fa":"برای نتیجه‌گیری خیلی کوچک","note":"too + adj + to","traps":[],"distractors":["so","very to"]},{"id":"awl127","unit":"awl_c1","skill":"vocabulary","level":"C1","kind":"cloze","prompt":"The curve ___ sharply after 2010.","answer":"steepens","alt":[],"en":"steepen","fa":"تندتر شدن","note":"a steep rise","traps":[],"distractors":["stiffens","sharps"]},{"id":"awl128","unit":"awl_c1","skill":"vocabulary","level":"C1","kind":"cloze","prompt":"The drug is ___ administered twice daily.","answer":"typically","alt":[],"en":"typically","fa":"به‌طور معمول","note":"typically = usually","traps":[],"distractors":["typical","type"]},{"id":"awl129","unit":"awl_c1","skill":"vocabulary","level":"C1","kind":"cloze","prompt":"The effect size was ___ significant.","answer":"marginally","alt":[],"en":"marginally","fa":"در حد مرز، اندک","note":"marginally significant","traps":[],"distractors":["marginal","margin"]},{"id":"awl130","unit":"awl_c1","skill":"vocabulary","level":"C1","kind":"cloze","prompt":"The author ___ a bolder interpretation.","answer":"adopts","alt":[],"en":"adopt","fa":"پذیرفتن یک رویکرد","note":"adopt an approach","traps":[],"distractors":["adapt","accept in"]},{"id":"awl131","unit":"awl_c1","skill":"vocabulary","level":"C1","kind":"cloze","prompt":"Critics ___ the methodology as flawed.","answer":"characterize","alt":[],"en":"characterize as","fa":"توصیف کردن به عنوان","note":"characterize something as","traps":[],"distractors":["character","qualify of"]},{"id":"awl132","unit":"awl_c1","skill":"vocabulary","level":"C1","kind":"cloze","prompt":"The two datasets are directly ___ .","answer":"comparable","alt":[],"en":"comparable","fa":"مقایسه‌پذیر","note":"comparable with/to","traps":[],"distractors":["comparative","compatible"]},{"id":"grm133","unit":"grm_articles","skill":"grammar","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"We watched ___ film about the Silk Road.","answer":"a","alt":[],"en":"a film","fa":"یک فیلم (نامعین)","note":"First mention takes a/an.","traps":["articles"],"distractors":["the","one of"]},{"id":"grm134","unit":"grm_articles","skill":"grammar","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"She is ___ engineer at a telecom firm.","answer":"an","alt":[],"en":"an engineer","fa":"مهندس (قبل از حرف صدادار an)","note":"an before vowel sounds.","traps":["articles"],"distractors":["a","the"]},{"id":"grm135","unit":"grm_articles","skill":"grammar","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"___ moon looked enormous last night.","answer":"The","alt":[],"en":"the moon","fa":"ماه (یگانه: the)","note":"Unique things take the.","traps":["articles"],"distractors":["A","One"]},{"id":"grm136","unit":"grm_articles","skill":"grammar","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"I saw ___ movie yesterday; it was dull.","answer":"the","alt":[],"en":"the movie","fa":"فیلم را دیدم (معین)","note":"Persian has no articles: second mention takes the.","traps":["articles"],"distractors":["a","one"]},{"id":"grm137","unit":"grm_articles","skill":"grammar","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"They praised ___ honesty of the report.","answer":"the","alt":[],"en":"the honesty of the report","fa":"صداقتِ گزارش (با حرف تعریف)","note":"A specific abstract noun takes the definite article.","traps":["articles"],"distractors":["A","An"]},{"id":"grm138","unit":"grm_articles","skill":"grammar","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"She visited ___ prison where her brother worked.","answer":"the","alt":[],"en":"the prison where her brother worked","fa":"آن زندانِ مشخص (با حرف تعریف)","note":"the prison = the specific building; to prison = as a prisoner.","traps":["articles"],"distractors":["a","an"]},{"id":"grm139","unit":"grm_count","skill":"grammar","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"She gave me a useful piece of ___ .","answer":"advice","alt":[],"en":"advice","fa":"توصیه (شمارش‌ناپذیر)","note":"advice is uncountable: a piece of advice.","traps":["countability","plurals"],"distractors":["advices","advise"]},{"id":"grm140","unit":"grm_count","skill":"grammar","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"How much ___ do you get per week?","answer":"homework","alt":[],"en":"homework","fa":"تکلیف (شمارش‌ناپذیر)","note":"homework is uncountable.","traps":["countability","plurals"],"distractors":["homeworks","a homework"]},{"id":"grm141","unit":"grm_count","skill":"grammar","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"The article contains several sharp ___ .","answer":"criticisms","alt":[],"en":"criticism","fa":"نقد (جمع بی‌قاعده معنایی)","note":"criticism uncountable; criticisms = specific critiques.","traps":["countability","plurals"],"distractors":["criticism s","critiques s"]},{"id":"grm142","unit":"grm_count","skill":"grammar","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"How ___ books did you read last year?","answer":"many","alt":[],"en":"many","fa":"چند (برای قابل‌شمارش)","note":"many + countable; much + uncountable.","traps":["countability","plurals"],"distractors":["much","lot"]},{"id":"grm143","unit":"grm_count","skill":"grammar","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"___ students failed than last term.","answer":"Fewer","alt":[],"en":"fewer","fa":"کمتر (قابل‌شمارش)","note":"fewer for countable, less for uncountable.","traps":["countability","plurals"],"distractors":["Less","Few of"]},{"id":"grm144","unit":"grm_count","skill":"grammar","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"I bought two ___ for the trip.","answer":"books","alt":[],"en":"books","fa":"کتاب (بعد از عدد جمع می‌آید)","note":"English marks plural after numbers; Persian does not: do ketab.","traps":["countability","plurals"],"distractors":["book","bookes"]},{"id":"grm145","unit":"grm_count","skill":"grammar","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"Ten ___ ago we had no smartphones.","answer":"years","alt":[],"en":"years","fa":"سال (جمع بعد از عدد)","note":"ten years ago","traps":["countability","plurals"],"distractors":["year","yaers"]},{"id":"grm146","unit":"grm_count","skill":"grammar","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"The news ___ better than expected.","answer":"was","alt":[],"en":"was","fa":"خبر بود (مفرد)","note":"news is singular in English.","traps":["countability","plurals"],"distractors":["were","is being"]},{"id":"grm147","unit":"grm_copula","skill":"grammar","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"He ___ a teacher at a girls' school.","answer":"is","alt":[],"en":"is","fa":"است (فعل بودن حال)","note":"Persian attaches the copula as a suffix (-e); English needs is/are.","traps":["copula","statives"],"distractors":["nothing","be"]},{"id":"grm148","unit":"grm_copula","skill":"grammar","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"This book ___ interesting so far.","answer":"is","alt":[],"en":"is","fa":"است","note":"English needs an explicit verb in present.","traps":["copula","statives"],"distractors":["being","looks as"]},{"id":"grm149","unit":"grm_copula","skill":"grammar","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"I ___ the answer right now.","answer":"know","alt":[],"en":"know","fa":"می‌دانم (حال ساده)","note":"Stative verbs resist -ing: I know, not I am knowing.","traps":["copula","statives"],"distractors":["am knowing","do know to"]},{"id":"grm150","unit":"grm_copula","skill":"grammar","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"She ___ her coffee at the moment.","answer":"enjoys","alt":[],"en":"enjoy","fa":"لذت می‌برد","note":"Enjoy is not stative: she is enjoying is fine. Careful set.","traps":["copula","statives"],"distractors":["is enjoying her","enjoy"]},{"id":"grm151","unit":"grm_copula","skill":"grammar","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"They ___ to leave early today.","answer":"want","alt":[],"en":"want","fa":"می‌خواهند","note":"want is stative: I want, never I am wanting.","traps":["copula","statives"],"distractors":["are wanting","do want to"]},{"id":"grm152","unit":"grm_copula","skill":"grammar","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"This sauce ___ garlic.","answer":"tastes of","alt":[],"en":"taste of","fa":"طعم چیزی را دادن","note":"taste of = has the flavor (stative use).","traps":["copula","statives"],"distractors":["is tasting of","tastes like of"]},{"id":"grm153","unit":"grm_prep","skill":"grammar","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"The meeting is ___ Monday morning.","answer":"on","alt":[],"en":"on Monday","fa":"روی/در روزها: on","note":"English uses on for days; Persian 'dar' covers all.","traps":["prepositions"],"distractors":["in","at"]},{"id":"grm154","unit":"grm_prep","skill":"grammar","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"I stayed ___ home and studied.","answer":"at","alt":[],"en":"at home","fa":"در خانه: at","note":"at home is the fixed phrase.","traps":["prepositions"],"distractors":["in","on"]},{"id":"grm155","unit":"grm_prep","skill":"grammar","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"She is married ___ an architect.","answer":"to","alt":[],"en":"married to","fa":"متأهل با: married to","note":"married to someone (never 'married with').","traps":["prepositions"],"distractors":["with","by"]},{"id":"grm156","unit":"grm_prep","skill":"grammar","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"Success depends ___ consistent practice.","answer":"on","alt":[],"en":"depend on","fa":"بستگی داشتن به","note":"depend on someone/something.","traps":["prepositions"],"distractors":["of","from"]},{"id":"grm157","unit":"grm_prep","skill":"grammar","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"We arrived ___ the airport at dawn.","answer":"at","alt":[],"en":"arrive at","fa":"رسیدن به (مکان)","note":"arrive at a point, arrive in a city.","traps":["prepositions"],"distractors":["in","to"]},{"id":"grm158","unit":"grm_prep","skill":"grammar","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"He is good ___ explaining hard ideas.","answer":"at","alt":[],"en":"good at","fa":"خوب بودن در","note":"good at something/doing.","traps":["prepositions"],"distractors":["in","on"]},{"id":"grm159","unit":"grm_prep","skill":"grammar","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"The office is ___ the third floor.","answer":"on","alt":[],"en":"on the floor","fa":"در طبقه: on","note":"on the third floor.","traps":["prepositions"],"distractors":["in","at"]},{"id":"grm160","unit":"grm_prep","skill":"grammar","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"I will travel ___ Friday morning.","answer":"on","alt":[],"en":"on Friday","fa":"روز جمعه: on","note":"on Friday morning.","traps":["prepositions"],"distractors":["in","at"]},{"id":"grm161","unit":"grm_tense","skill":"grammar","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"I ___ him at the conference yesterday.","answer":"saw","alt":[],"en":"saw","fa":"دیدم (گذشته ساده)","note":"Finished time words (yesterday) take simple past; Persian rafte-am misleads.","traps":["perfect"],"distractors":["have seen","had seen"]},{"id":"grm162","unit":"grm_tense","skill":"grammar","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"I ___ here since Monday.","answer":"have been","alt":[],"en":"have been","fa":"هستم (از دوشنبه تا حالا)","note":"since + present perfect; Persian uses present: az doshanbe hastam.","traps":["perfect"],"distractors":["am","was"]},{"id":"grm163","unit":"grm_tense","skill":"grammar","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"She ___ her keys; she cannot get in.","answer":"has lost","alt":[],"en":"has lost","fa":"گم کرده (نتیجه حال حاضر)","note":"Present perfect for present result.","traps":["perfect"],"distractors":["lost","had lost"]},{"id":"grm164","unit":"grm_tense","skill":"grammar","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"When ___ you buy that jacket?","answer":"did","alt":[],"en":"did you buy","fa":"کی خریدی؟","note":"Questions about finished time use did.","traps":["perfect"],"distractors":["have","were"]},{"id":"grm165","unit":"grm_tense","skill":"grammar","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"This is the best film I ___ this year.","answer":"have seen","alt":[],"en":"have seen","fa":"دیده‌ام (تا حالا)","note":"Superlative + ever/this year takes present perfect.","traps":["perfect"],"distractors":["saw","had seen"]},{"id":"grm166","unit":"grm_tense","skill":"grammar","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"By the time we arrived, the talk ___ .","answer":"had ended","alt":[],"en":"had ended","fa":"تمام شده بود (گذشته پیشین)","note":"Earlier past takes past perfect.","traps":["perfect"],"distractors":["has ended","ended already"]},{"id":"grm167","unit":"grm_struct","skill":"grammar","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"Do you know where the station ___ ?","answer":"is","alt":[],"en":"where the station is","fa":"کجاست (ترتیب غیرمستقیم)","note":"Embedded questions drop do/does and keep subject+verb order.","traps":["question_order"],"distractors":["is the station","does the station is"]},{"id":"grm168","unit":"grm_struct","skill":"grammar","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"I wonder where she ___ last night.","answer":"went","alt":[],"en":"where she went","fa":"کجا رفت","note":"No aux in embedded questions.","traps":["question_order"],"distractors":["did go","did she go"]},{"id":"grm169","unit":"grm_struct","skill":"grammar","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"He asked me where I ___ .","answer":"lived","alt":[],"en":"where I lived","fa":"کجا زندگی می‌کردم","note":"Persian 'ke' is not English 'that' here.","traps":["question_order"],"distractors":["do live","that I lived"]},{"id":"grm170","unit":"grm_struct","skill":"grammar","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"___ is important to review daily.","answer":"It","alt":[],"en":"It is important","fa":"این مهم است","note":"English needs a dummy subject; Persian drops it.","traps":["that_omission"],"distractors":["That","This is"]},{"id":"grm171","unit":"grm_struct","skill":"grammar","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"It was an ___ film about memory.","answer":"interesting","alt":[],"en":"an interesting film","fa":"فیلم جالبی","note":"Adjective precedes the noun; Persian puts it after.","traps":["adjectives"],"distractors":["film interesting","interested"]},{"id":"grm172","unit":"grm_struct","skill":"grammar","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"She wore a ___ jacket to the interview.","answer":"beautiful leather","alt":[],"en":"a beautiful leather jacket","fa":"کت چرمی زیبا","note":"Opinion before material: beautiful leather.","traps":["adjectives"],"distractors":["leather beautiful","leathered beautiful"]},{"id":"grm173","unit":"grm_struct","skill":"grammar","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"The engineer ___ designed the bridge won a prize.","answer":"who","alt":[],"en":"who","fa":"که (فاعل)","note":"who for people as subject; which for things.","traps":[],"distractors":["which","whom"]},{"id":"grm174","unit":"grm_struct","skill":"grammar","level":"B2","kind":"cloze","prompt":"A ___ of birds settled on the wire.","answer":"flock","alt":[],"en":"a flock of birds","fa":"دسته‌ای از پرندگان","note":"Collective: a flock of birds.","traps":[],"distractors":["group bird","herd"]},{"id":"reg175","unit":"register","skill":"grammar","level":"C1","kind":"cloze","prompt":"In formal reports, ___ obtain is preferred to get.","answer":"formal","alt":[],"en":"obtain (formal)","fa":"به دست آوردن (رسمی)","note":"get is fine in speech; obtain in writing.","traps":[],"distractors":["slang","casual"]},{"id":"reg176","unit":"register","skill":"grammar","level":"C1","kind":"cloze","prompt":"The committee will ___ the findings next week.","answer":"consider","alt":[],"en":"consider","fa":"بررسی و مد نظر قرار دادن","note":"think about → consider in writing.","traps":[],"distractors":["think over on","ponder of"]},{"id":"reg177","unit":"register","skill":"grammar","level":"C1","kind":"cloze","prompt":"We must ___ the data before publishing.","answer":"verify","alt":[],"en":"verify","fa":"راستی‌آزمایی کردن","note":"check → verify in formal register.","traps":[],"distractors":["check out","vet out"]},{"id":"reg178","unit":"register","skill":"grammar","level":"C1","kind":"cloze","prompt":"The contract was ___ by both parties.","answer":"terminated","alt":[],"en":"terminated","fa":"فسخ شد","note":"end → terminate in legal register.","traps":[],"distractors":["terminated up","ended off"]},{"id":"reg179","unit":"register","skill":"grammar","level":"C1","kind":"cloze","prompt":"___ the figures rose, morale fell.","answer":"Whereas","alt":[],"en":"whereas","fa":"در حالی که (مقایسه رسمی)","note":"whereas links contrast in writing.","traps":[],"distractors":["While that","Where as"]},{"id":"reg180","unit":"register","skill":"grammar","level":"C1","kind":"cloze","prompt":"The results were ___; no action is needed.","answer":"inconclusive","alt":[],"en":"inconclusive","fa":"بی‌نتیجه","note":"in- + conclusive.","traps":[],"distractors":["unconclusive","nonconclusive"]},{"id":"reg181","unit":"register","skill":"grammar","level":"C1","kind":"cloze","prompt":"___ the delay, the shipment arrived intact.","answer":"Despite","alt":[],"en":"despite","fa":"علی‌رغم (بدون of)","note":"despite + noun (no of); in spite of + noun.","traps":[],"distractors":["Despite of","Although"]},{"id":"reg182","unit":"register","skill":"grammar","level":"C1","kind":"cloze","prompt":"The drug is safe, ___ expensive to produce.","answer":"albeit","alt":[],"en":"albeit","fa":"هرچند (ادبی)","note":"albeit = although, formal single word.","traps":[],"distractors":["allbeit","through"]},{"id":"reg183","unit":"register","skill":"grammar","level":"C1","kind":"cloze","prompt":"Costs fell, ___ boosting quarterly profit.","answer":"thereby","alt":[],"en":"thereby","fa":"بدین ترتیب (رسمی)","note":"thereby + ing shows result.","traps":[],"distractors":["there for","hence of"]},{"id":"reg184","unit":"register","skill":"grammar","level":"C1","kind":"cloze","prompt":"___ , the two studies agree on the basics.","answer":"On balance","alt":[],"en":"on balance","fa":"در مجموع","note":"on balance = after weighing everything.","traps":[],"distractors":["In balance","At balance"]},{"id":"wb185","unit":"wordbuild","skill":"vocabulary","level":"C1","kind":"cloze","prompt":"The ___ of the bridge took three years.","answer":"construction","alt":[],"en":"construction","fa":"ساخت","note":"construct (v) → construction (n).","traps":[],"distractors":["constructing word","construct"]},{"id":"wb186","unit":"wordbuild","skill":"vocabulary","level":"C1","kind":"cloze","prompt":"Their ___ was visible after the first win.","answer":"confidence","alt":[],"en":"confidence","fa":"اطمینان","note":"confident (adj) → confidence (n).","traps":[],"distractors":["confidency","confide"]},{"id":"wb187","unit":"wordbuild","skill":"vocabulary","level":"C1","kind":"cloze","prompt":"The plan died from pure ___ .","answer":"neglect","alt":[],"en":"neglect","fa":"بی‌مهری و رها شدن","note":"neglect (n and v).","traps":[],"distractors":["neglection","neglectment"]},{"id":"wb188","unit":"wordbuild","skill":"vocabulary","level":"C1","kind":"cloze","prompt":"He answered with surprising ___ .","answer":"honesty","alt":[],"en":"honesty","fa":"صداقت","note":"honest → honesty.","traps":[],"distractors":["honestness","honestation"]},{"id":"wb189","unit":"wordbuild","skill":"vocabulary","level":"C1","kind":"cloze","prompt":"There is strong ___ for the new policy.","answer":"opposition","alt":[],"en":"opposition","fa":"مخالفت","note":"oppose → opposition.","traps":[],"distractors":["opposal","opposing"]},{"id":"wb190","unit":"wordbuild","skill":"vocabulary","level":"C1","kind":"cloze","prompt":"They measured the ___ of the canyon.","answer":"depth","alt":[],"en":"depth","fa":"عمق","note":"deep → depth; long → length; wide → width.","traps":[],"distractors":["deepness","deepth"]},{"id":"wb191","unit":"wordbuild","skill":"vocabulary","level":"C1","kind":"cloze","prompt":"The ___ of the law took decades.","answer":"enforcement","alt":[],"en":"enforcement","fa":"اجرای قانون","note":"enforce → enforcement.","traps":[],"distractors":["enforcing word","enforcity"]},{"id":"wb192","unit":"wordbuild","skill":"vocabulary","level":"C1","kind":"cloze","prompt":"It is ___ to park across two spaces.","answer":"illegal","alt":[],"en":"illegal","fa":"غیرقانونی","note":"il- before l: illegal.","traps":[],"distractors":["unlegal","dislegal"]},{"id":"wb193","unit":"wordbuild","skill":"vocabulary","level":"C1","kind":"cloze","prompt":"Her excuse was completely ___ .","answer":"implausible","alt":[],"en":"implausible","fa":"باورنکردنی","note":"im- before p: implausible.","traps":[],"distractors":["unplausible","displausible"]},{"id":"wb194","unit":"wordbuild","skill":"vocabulary","level":"C1","kind":"cloze","prompt":"The survey found growing ___ with the app.","answer":"dissatisfaction","alt":[],"en":"dissatisfaction","fa":"نارضایتی","note":"dis- + satisfaction.","traps":[],"distractors":["unsatisfaction","missatisfaction"]},{"id":"wb195","unit":"wordbuild","skill":"vocabulary","level":"C1","kind":"cloze","prompt":"The two accounts are ___ inconsistent.","answer":"mutually","alt":[],"en":"mutually","fa":"به‌طور متقابل","note":"mutual → mutually.","traps":[],"distractors":["mutuality","mutual"]},{"id":"wb196","unit":"wordbuild","skill":"vocabulary","level":"C1","kind":"cloze","prompt":"___ speaking, the second draft is stronger.","answer":"Broadly","alt":[],"en":"broadly speaking","fa":"در مجموع، کلی‌گفته","note":"broadly speaking = in general.","traps":[],"distractors":["Broad","Broady"]},{"id":"ef197","unit":"ef_core","skill":"vocabulary","level":"B2","kind":"ef","prompt":"","answer":"","alt":[],"en":"to achieve","fa":"به دست آوردن، محقق کردن","note":"recall the Farsi meaning, then check","traps":[],"distractors":[]},{"id":"ef198","unit":"ef_core","skill":"vocabulary","level":"B2","kind":"ef","prompt":"","answer":"","alt":[],"en":"reliable","fa":"قابل اعتماد","note":"recall the Farsi meaning, then check","traps":[],"distractors":[]},{"id":"ef199","unit":"ef_core","skill":"vocabulary","level":"B2","kind":"ef","prompt":"","answer":"","alt":[],"en":"to postpone","fa":"به تعویق انداختن","note":"recall the Farsi meaning, then check","traps":[],"distractors":[]},{"id":"ef200","unit":"ef_core","skill":"vocabulary","level":"B2","kind":"ef","prompt":"","answer":"","alt":[],"en":"a deadline","fa":"ضرب‌الاجل","note":"recall the Farsi meaning, then check","traps":[],"distractors":[]},{"id":"ef201","unit":"ef_core","skill":"vocabulary","level":"B2","kind":"ef","prompt":"","answer":"","alt":[],"en":"to afford","fa":"از پس هزینه‌ای برآمدن","note":"recall the Farsi meaning, then check","traps":[],"distractors":[]},{"id":"ef202","unit":"ef_core","skill":"vocabulary","level":"B2","kind":"ef","prompt":"","answer":"","alt":[],"en":"an advantage","fa":"مزیت","note":"recall the Farsi meaning, then check","traps":[],"distractors":[]},{"id":"ef203","unit":"ef_core","skill":"vocabulary","level":"B2","kind":"ef","prompt":"","answer":"","alt":[],"en":"to improve","fa":"بهبود بخشیدن","note":"recall the Farsi meaning, then check","traps":[],"distractors":[]},{"id":"ef204","unit":"ef_core","skill":"vocabulary","level":"B2","kind":"ef","prompt":"","answer":"","alt":[],"en":"surprising","fa":"شگفت‌انگیز","note":"recall the Farsi meaning, then check","traps":[],"distractors":[]},{"id":"ef205","unit":"ef_core","skill":"vocabulary","level":"B2","kind":"ef","prompt":"","answer":"","alt":[],"en":"necessary","fa":"ضروری","note":"recall the Farsi meaning, then check","traps":[],"distractors":[]},{"id":"ef206","unit":"ef_core","skill":"vocabulary","level":"B2","kind":"ef","prompt":"","answer":"","alt":[],"en":"to suggest","fa":"پیشنهاد دادن، نشان دادن","note":"recall the Farsi meaning, then check","traps":[],"distractors":[]},{"id":"ef207","unit":"ef_core","skill":"vocabulary","level":"B2","kind":"ef","prompt":"","answer":"","alt":[],"en":"eventually","fa":"سرانجام","note":"recall the Farsi meaning, then check","traps":[],"distractors":[]},{"id":"ef208","unit":"ef_core","skill":"vocabulary","level":"B2","kind":"ef","prompt":"","answer":"","alt":[],"en":"careless","fa":"بی‌دقت، سهل‌انگار","note":"recall the Farsi meaning, then check","traps":[],"distractors":[]},{"id":"fae209","unit":"fae_core","skill":"vocabulary","level":"B2","kind":"fae","prompt":"","answer":"","alt":[],"en":"discuss","fa":"بحث کردن درباره","note":"produce the English word","traps":[],"distractors":[]},{"id":"fae210","unit":"fae_core","skill":"vocabulary","level":"B2","kind":"fae","prompt":"","answer":"","alt":[],"en":"available","fa":"در دسترس","note":"produce the English word","traps":[],"distractors":[]},{"id":"fae211","unit":"fae_core","skill":"vocabulary","level":"B2","kind":"fae","prompt":"","answer":"","alt":[],"en":"calm","fa":"خونسرد، آرام","note":"produce the English word","traps":[],"distractors":[]},{"id":"fae212","unit":"fae_core","skill":"vocabulary","level":"B2","kind":"fae","prompt":"","answer":"","alt":[],"en":"experience","fa":"تجربه","note":"produce the English word","traps":[],"distractors":[]},{"id":"fae213","unit":"fae_core","skill":"vocabulary","level":"B2","kind":"fae","prompt":"","answer":"","alt":[],"en":"opportunity","fa":"فرصت","note":"produce the English word","traps":[],"distractors":[]},{"id":"fae214","unit":"fae_core","skill":"vocabulary","level":"B2","kind":"fae","prompt":"","answer":"","alt":[],"en":"responsible","fa":"مسئولیت‌پذیر","note":"produce the English word","traps":[],"distractors":[]},{"id":"fae215","unit":"fae_core","skill":"vocabulary","level":"B2","kind":"fae","prompt":"","answer":"","alt":[],"en":"improvement","fa":"بهبود","note":"produce the English word","traps":[],"distractors":[]},{"id":"fae216","unit":"fae_core","skill":"vocabulary","level":"B2","kind":"fae","prompt":"","answer":"","alt":[],"en":"difficult","fa":"دشوار، سخت","note":"produce the English word","traps":[],"distractors":[]},{"id":"sent217","unit":"sent_core","skill":"grammar","level":"B2","kind":"sent","prompt":"Type the full sentence: 'I / see / that movie / twice' (present perfect)","answer":"I have seen that movie twice.","alt":[],"en":"I have seen that movie twice.","fa":"آن فیلم را دوبار دیده‌ام.","note":"Present perfect with twice.","traps":["I seen that movie twice.","I have saw that movie twice."],"distractors":[]},{"id":"sent218","unit":"sent_core","skill":"grammar","level":"B2","kind":"sent","prompt":"Type the full sentence: 'Do you know / where / is / the exit?' (embedded)","answer":"Do you know where the exit is?","alt":[],"en":"Do you know where the exit is?","fa":"می‌دانی خروجی کجاست؟","note":"Embedded question word order.","traps":["Do you know where is the exit?","Do you know where is exit?"],"distractors":[]}]}